# Idle guild chat between guildmates (kind guild), by the guild's charter (@topic). "general" fits any
# guild. Replaces AutonomousBotGuildChatLines.Idle(). Lines ask and suggest; they never promise what a
# guildmate will do. New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

# ---------------- Leveling guilds ----------------
@kind guild
@topic leveling
@who *
{level} {class} here, anyone close in level?
@invites lfg
who is leveling tonight? could use the company
@invites
anyone know a good camp around {level}?
anyone else stuck in the slow levels?
@invites lfg
{dungeon} anyone? heard its good at our level
@invites
anyone free to heal for a couple hours of xp?
@invites ask_anyone
guild group in 20 at {camp}?
half a level to go, anyone want to help me push?
@invites ask
what level is everyone at now?
@invites chat
{camp} was good xp for me, worth a look around {level}
whoever told me about {camp}, ty
at {camp}, room for one more if you want the xp
need two bubbles to ding, grinding solo till then
leveling an alt tonight, dont mind me
leveling with you lot makes the slow nights go faster
@invites complaint
i swear this level is twice as long as the last one
solo xp is crawling tonight
@invites boast
got a full bubble on one pull, best camp yet
new camp, everything cons yellow, xp is great
@needs just_leveled
dinged {level}, slowly getting there

